#: ../ganxy-embed-plugin.php:73
msgid ""
"This plugin creates what is called a \"shortcode\". This shortcode has a "
"placeholder image that is displayed in the visual editor for an easy visual "
"queue of where the product will be in relation to your content. If you are "
